            "text": "<p><strong style=\"color:yellow\">Current Version</strong></p><p><span class=\"ajx\" onclick=\"openLevel('SkagitCounty1401');\" id=\"spanSkagitCounty1401\">+</span> <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"code\" onclick=\"checker('SkagitCounty1401', this.checked);\" class=\"SkagitCounty14 SkagitCounty1401\"  value=\"../html/SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1401.html#14.01\"> <a href=\"/WA/SkagitCounty/#!/SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1401.html#14.01\" id=\"SkagitCounty1401\">Chapter 14.01 HOW TO USE THE UNIFIED DEVELOPMENT CODE</a></p>\n<div class=\"ptoc2\" style=\"display: none\" id=\"divSkagitCounty1401\">\n<p>&bull; <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"code\" onclick=\"checker('SkagitCounty1401xx14x01x010', this.checked);\" class=\"SkagitCounty14 SkagitCounty1401 SkagitCounty1401xx14x01x010\"  value=\"../html/SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1401.html#14.01.010\"> <a href=\"/WA/SkagitCounty/#!/SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1401.html#14.01.010\" id=\"SkagitCounty1401xx14x01x010\">14.01.010 About the Code</a></p>\n<div class=\"ptoc2\" style=\"display: none\" id=\"divSkagitCounty1401xx14x01x010\">\n</div>\n<p>&bull; <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"code\" onclick=\"checker('SkagitCounty1401xx14x01x020', this.checked);\" class=\"SkagitCounty14 SkagitCounty1401 SkagitCounty1401xx14x01x020\"  value=\"../html/SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1401.html#14.01.020\"> <a href=\"/WA/SkagitCounty/#!/SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1401.html#14.01.020\" id=\"SkagitCounty1401xx14x01x020\">14.01.020 Orientation to SCC Title 14</a></p>\n<div class=\"ptoc2\" style=\"display: none\" id=\"divSkagitCounty1401xx14x01x020\">\n</div>\n<p>&bull; <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"code\" onclick=\"checker('SkagitCounty1401xx14x01x030', this.checked);\" class=\"SkagitCounty14 SkagitCounty1401 SkagitCounty1401xx14x01x030\"  value=\"../html/SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1401.html#14.01.030\"> <a href=\"/WA/SkagitCounty/#!/SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1401.html#14.01.030\" id=\"SkagitCounty1401xx14x01x030\">14.01.030 Exam