          "content": {
            "size": 85238,
            "mimeType": "text/html",
            "text": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\r\n<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\r\n<html xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\r\n  <head>\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=utf-8\" />\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Style-Type\" content=\"text/css\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"format-detection\" content=\"telephone=no\" />\r\n\t<title>ORDINANCE TABLE</title>\r\n\t<link href=\"../css/body.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" />\r\n    \r\n    \r\n  </head>\r\n  <body>\r\n    <!--BeginNoIndex-->\r\n    <div id=\"navTop\">\r\n      <a href=\"/WA/SkagitCounty\">\r\n        <img src=\"images/toc.gif\" alt=\"Home\" border=\"0\" />\r\n      </a>\r\n      <a href=\"SkagitCountySR.html\">\r\n        <img src=\"images/prev.gif\" alt=\"Previous\" border=\"0\" />\r\n      </a>\r\n      <img src=\"images/nextx.gif\" alt=\"Next\" border=\"0\" />\r\n    </div>\r\n    <!--EndNoIndex-->\r\n    <div id=\"mainContent\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"Title\"><a name=\"OT\"></a>ORDINANCE TABLE</h1>\r\n            <p class=\"P1\">The ordinances and resolutions listed in this table include those that have affected the Skagit County Code since May, 2001. A comprehensive listing of ordinances, to include all codified county legislation, is under consideration, and will be published in a future supplement to the code.</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><th><p class=\"CellHeadingL\">RESOLUTION/ORDINANCE NUMBER</p></th><th><p class=\"CellHeadingL\"></p></th></tr>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td><p class=\"ordtab\">8859</p></td><td><p class=\"ordtab\">Emergency services council (Repealed by O20140003)</p></td></tr>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td><p class=\"ordtab\"><span>16380</span></p></td><td><p class=\"ordtab\">Conservation futures fund (<a href=\"SkagitCounty03/SkagitCounty0318.html#3.18\">3.18</a>)</p></td></tr>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td><p class=\"ordtab\"><span>17938</span></p></td><td><p class=\"ordtab\">Unified development code (<a href=\"SkagitCounty01/SkagitCounty0142.html#1.42\">1.42</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty03/SkagitCounty0321.html#3.21\">3.21</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1402.html#14.02\">14.02</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1404.html#14.04\">14.04</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1408.html#14.08\">14.08</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1409.html#14.09\">14.09</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1424.html#14.24\">14.24</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1432.html#14.32\">14.32</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1434.html#14.34\">14.34</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1438.html#14.38\">14.38</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1442.html#14.42\">14.42</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1448.html#14.48\">14.48</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1453.html#14.53\">14.53</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1458.html#14.58\">14.58</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1462.html#14.62\">14.62</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1466.html#14.66\">14.66</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1468.html#14.68\">14.68</a>, Title <a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty14.html#14\">14</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty15/SkagitCounty1504.html#15.04\">15.04</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty16/SkagitCounty1612.html#16.12\">16.12</a>)</p></td></tr>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td><p class=\"ordtab\"><span>18249</span></p></td><td><p class=\"ordtab\">Lake Management District No. 3 (<a href=\"SkagitCounty06/SkagitCounty0672.html#6.72\">6.72</a>)</p></td></tr>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td><p class=\"ordtab\">18264</p></td><td><p class=\"ordtab\">Adds &sect; 14.16.215, Bayview Ridge Urban Growth Area; repeals Ord. 18098 (Repealed by O20060007)</p></td></tr>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td><p class=\"ordtab\"><span>18282</span></p></td><td><p class=\"ordtab\">Amends &sect; 1.20.010, voting precincts (<a href=\"SkagitCounty01/SkagitCounty0120.html#1.20\">1.20</a>)</p></td></tr>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td><p class=\"ordtab\"><span>18283</span></p></td><td><p class=\"ordtab\">Agent to receive service of damage claims (<a href=\"SkagitCounty02/SkagitCounty0240.html#2.40\">2.40</a>)</p></td></tr>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td><p class=\"ordtab\">18293</p></td><td><p class=\"ordtab\">Amends &sect; 14.02.040, unified development code applicability (Repealed by O20050007)</p></td></tr>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td><p class=\"ordtab\"><span>18339</span></p></td><td><p class=\"ordtab\">Amends Ch. 12.36, Skagit County food establishments (<a href=\"SkagitCounty12/SkagitCounty1236.html#12.36\">12.36</a>)</p></td></tr>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td><p class=\"ordtab\"><span>18375</span></p></td><td><p class=\"ordtab\">Incorporates various urban growth area regulations; amends &sect;&sect; 14.02.040, 14.04.020, 14.10.020(1) and 14.16.400&mdash;14.16.430, unified development code (<a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1402.html#14.02\">14.02</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1404.html#14.04\">14.04</a>, <a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty1458.html#14.58\">14.58</a>, Title <a href=\"SkagitCounty14/SkagitCounty14.html#14\">14</a>)</p></td></tr>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td><p class=\"ordtab\"><span>18390</span></p></td><td><p class=\"ordtab\">Amends &sect; 10.04.030, speed limits (<a href=\"SkagitCounty10/SkagitCounty1004.html#10.04\">10.04</a>)</p></td></tr>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td><p class=\"ordtab\"><span>18392</span></p></td><td><p class=\"ordtab\">Amends &sect; 10.04.030, speed limits (<a href=\"SkagitCounty10/SkagitCounty1004.html#10.04\">10.04</a>)</p></td></tr>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td><p class=\"ordtab\"><span>18464</span></p></td><td><p class=\"ordtab\">Amends &sect; 11.30.010, primitive roads (<a href=\"SkagitCounty11/SkagitCounty1130.html#11.30\">11.30</a>)</p></td></tr>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td><p class=\"ordtab\"><span>18486</span></p></td><td><p class=\"ordtab\">Amends &sect; 14.02